  "title": "Ozma of Oz - Endnotes (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "It may surprise you to learn that a princess ever does such a common thing as darn stockings. But, if you will stop to think, you will realize that a princess is sure to wear holes in her stockings, the same as other people; only it isn’t considered quite polite to mention the matter. ↩",
